# Copy thành .dev.vars để chạy `npm run dev` (file .dev.vars KHÔNG commit).
# Production: `npx wrangler secret put ASIAPAY_SECURE_HASH_SECRET` và `npx wrangler secret put ASIAPAY_API_PASSWORD`.
# Secure Hash Secret lấy trong Merchant Admin (https://test.paydollar.com/b2cDemo/eng/merchant/index.html)
#   > Profile > Payment Account Information.
ASIAPAY_SECURE_HASH_SECRET=
ASIAPAY_API_PASSWORD=
SITE_URL=http://localhost:8787
